segments.en:
For eternity he will merit to spread his light — and until Mashiach our righteousness his lamp shall shine;
    and Mashiach with his da'as [divine knowledge] shall wage war — going ever toward the light until the day is firmly established:
    — He is our Rabbainu.

His holy grave is a Kodesh Kodoshim [Holy of Holies] — at every time and moment it renews new things;
    he promised that those who approach his grave in prayer go out from She'ol — even if they have passed through grievous sins:
    — He is our Rabbainu.

